  m_Name: GoatInfo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayName: Goat
  category: 1
  summary: Goats are amazing climbers with hollow horns! They first came from the
    mountains of Europe, Asia and northern Africa.
  facts:
  - Goats are smart and social, and they like to live together in herds.
  - Do goats eat tin cans? Nope! That's just a myth.
  - Baby goats are called kids! A mom usually has one to three, and they can follow
    her just a few hours after they're born.
  - Goats can live to be about 15 years old.
  sources:
  - Britannica for Students (Britannica Kids). Goat. https://kids.britannica.com/students/article/goat/274580
